---
layout: base.njk
title: "Writing"
description: "200+ essays by Aditya Jhunjhunwala on self-awareness, founders, education, relationships, and the work of building a life."
---
<div class="page-wrap page-wrap--wide">
  <div class="archive-header">
    <div style="font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold); margin-bottom:0.5rem;">{{ collections.articles | length }} Essays</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.5rem);">Writing</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-muted); max-width:520px; margin-top:0.75rem; font-size:0.9375rem;">
      Essays on self-awareness, founders, education, relationships, and the work of building a life. Written over 20 years.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="article-grid">
    {%- for article in collections.articles %}
    <div class="article-card">
      <div class="article-card__title"><a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a></div>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
